  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.15.0 adds typed OSC 133 extended semantic metadata while preserving the portable 0.12 A/B/C/D marker contract byte-for-byte. New prompt metadata covers secondary prompts, shell no-redraw declaration, special cursor-key declaration, and absolute/relative click events. New command-output metadata publishes explicit caller-supplied command lines through cross-terminal cmdline_url using strict UTF-8 byte percent encoding, uppercase percent escapes, malformed-Unicode rejection, and a 65,536-byte encoded payload bound. The release adds lifecycle/failure/concurrency hardening, real Icod.DCurses downstream acceptance, and a fresh net8/net9/net10 NuGet-only package contract. Shell-specific percent-q cmdline metadata, automatic command capture, and secret redaction remain deliberately excluded.",
